  "description": "Redevelopment of 2 sites, comprising residential dwellings (Use Class C3), associated landscaping, parking and storage. Further information not forming part of the formal description of development provided for consultation purposes:  The proposed development comprises the erection of two three-storey flatted blocks, contained over two parcels of land, referred to as the 'east site' (Site A) and 'west site' (Site B). Site A and Site B accommodate 11 and 10 three-bedroom dwellings, respectively, in the form of terraces. Car parking, landscaping and ramp access are proposed at the front of the site. Bin and cycle storage are located internally at the ground floor level.",
